    - target: {fileID: 3069562627216075266, guid: f3fb8aa42672de940b9dd64e803f7ed3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\rYou need to carry the logs that are blocking your way! Also, gather
        the essentials to put inside the go-bag, such as:  \r\n- Food  \r             
        - Important documents  \r                                                   
        - Hygiene kit  \r\n- Money  \r              - Flashlight  \r                             
        - Water bottle  \r                                                   - Clothes 
        \r\n- Towel  \r             - First aid kit  \r                                
        - Power bank  \r                                                   - Mobile
        phone  \r\nPicking up other items not listed will deduct your time.  \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
